(1. What is 30% of 1500?) '
(A\) 350) '
(B\) 450) '
(C\) 500) '
(D\) 550) '
(Answer: B) '
(Explanation: 30% of 1500 = 0.30 * 1500 = 450.) '
() '
(2. A man sells a bicycle for Rs 2400 making a profit of 20%. What was the cost price?) '
(A\) Rs 1800) '
(B\) Rs 2000) '
(C\) Rs 2100) '
(D\) Rs 2200) '
(Answer: B) '
(Explanation: 1.20 * CP = 2400, so CP = 2000.) '
() '
(3. A and B can do a work together in 8 days. A alone can do it in 12 days. How long will B take?) '
(A\) 16 days) '
(B\) 20 days) '
(C\) 24 days) '
(D\) 28 days) '
(Answer: C) '
(Explanation: 1/B = 1/8 - 1/12 = 1/24. B takes 24 days.) '
ET
